Yes, I needed one badly so I made my own.
It's really simple (KISS) at the moment but it's able to log
qso:s, keep track of stations, search for date, callsign, mode
etc. It's made  in PHP/Mysql/Apache and I do need to fix
things with it but the foundation is strong - the database is
modularized the way it should (not all data in one huge
table, such as some other projects do things).

I've put a test version on my server and it contains a few
qso's of mine:
http://abo.mine.nu/hamlogg/index.php

Feel free to try it out, if you want the source then just mail me.

73's de Per/SM0RWO



